From 91ac2dacc08d64221e92217419b29d1d0fb18ce9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: easiercloud <1223702268@qq.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Add strict offline FSDP2 actor entry and verified HF weight handoff

Keep the Megatron path while selecting the FSDP2 actor through Slime's
existing factory. The initial scope is fixed-rollout GRPO on eight NPUs.
Validate all-rank versioned exports and cold-load them in the real rollout
manager. Defer serving-only dependencies for offline training.

